title: "C23 gen-fut: matched commit, inactive publication and GC custody"
"gen-fut parent/child contexts" -> "Coordinate contract": "parent 1..S; child j maps S+j; return homes separate"
"Coordinate contract" -> "C return FrameSpec": "aligned parent fs=S-3; ordinary bits and structural link differ"
"C return FrameSpec" -> "GC stack/heap scan": "same addresses under stated descriptor/range premises"
"Canonical frame root" -> "Protected frame access": "resolve current stack/heap form after each grant"
"GC forwarding" -> "Canonical frame root": "repair roots and links; cached fp can be stale"
"Protected frame access" -> "Private rooted copy": "initialize once; collector updates registered fields"
"Private rooted copy" -> "Return decision commit": "fresh revision/generation/lease and prepared link patch"
"Child completion" -> "Pending result root": "does not authorize local fallback while RESERVED"
"Return decision commit" -> "LOCAL dispatch grant": "only definitive LOCAL; no SPLIT fallthrough"
"Return decision commit" -> "SPLIT dispatch grant": "only definitive SPLIT; parent roots held before queue activation"
"Closed all-role admission" -> "Domain reset": "all old holders gone before gate/generation reuse"
"Return decision commit" -> "Parent split/queue model": "paired logical commit preserves both actual-model Steps; activation gates dequeue; native linearization remains open"
