"Accepted inactive entry" -> "Matched split commit": "both actual models take commitSplit at one logical routing cut"
"Matched split commit" -> "Pending activation": "queue and copy stay rooted; SPLIT never falls through LOCAL"
"Pending activation" -> "Active task ledger": "activate same occurrence; retry failure preserves custody"
"Active task ledger" -> "Worker restore context": "acquire and single claim before queue-to-restore root handoff"
"Active task ledger" -> "Notification retry": "wake delivery is not ownership; duplicate/lost response does not restart parent"
"GC forwarding" -> "Accepted inactive entry": "stable rooted handle or all alias slots updated; actual adapter open"
"Worker restore context" -> "First parent result grant": "paired consume/grant once; result remains rooted"
"Child completion" -> "Matched split commit": "completion/commit commute under guards; result-ready bits must not be overwritten"
